{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "役", "id": "役"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "氣", "id": "氣"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "端", "id": "端"}, {"form": "羞", "id": "羞"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.6828653809889176, "source": "生", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.3706789920227488, "source": "生", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.7569733531426395, "source": "禮", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.063826172582694, "source": "禮", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.5301632413761213, "source": "禮", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 1.8370160608161759, "source": "禮", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.628775530044231, "source": "禮", "target": "役"}, {"weight": 2.7124847981700757, "source": "禮", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.3760125615488628, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.5530005488167035, "source": "心", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 0.3706789920227488, "source": "心", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.9584656569248678, "source": "心", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 1.7569733531426395, "source": "心", "target": "羞"}, {"weight": 1.7569733531426395, "source": "心", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 0.21652831219549054, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.5530005488167035, "source": "心", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.0193376176101303, "source": "智", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.2461477293766487, "source": "智", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 2.0193376176101303, "source"